Package: shadshiny
Title: 'shadcn/ui' Components for 'Shiny'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Arijit", "Ghosh", email = "arijitghosh2009@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A complete port of the 'shadcn/ui' design system for 'Shiny'
    applications: 49 accessible, themeable components implemented in
    framework-free CSS and vanilla JavaScript, wrapped as native R functions
    with 'Shiny' input bindings. Coexists with 'Bootstrap 5' and 'bslib',
    including automatic dark-mode synchronization.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
